# Captured material must never be committed. Since the library is now whatever
# directory you run `mfp` in, and running it inside this checkout is the normal
# way to use it, these are load-bearing rather than belt-and-braces.
*-University/
*-Lecture/
.mfp/
.captures/
!professor/

